  "rationale": "The frozen L2 selector grouped rows by condition but assigned conditions to folds by condition-ID hash. A validation condition could therefore be scored by a model trained on later conditions, which is not a prospective trading simulation and understates regime-shift risk. The correction uses five expanding chronological validation blocks, excludes the first seed block from validation, and applies the same ten-minute embargo used between the frozen campaign roles. Candidate families, model payloads, economic replay, AI authority, and every promotion threshold remain unchanged.",
